### Ingest chat message batch
POST {{SITE_URL}}/chat-messages/batch
X-Api-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "producerMessageId": "manual-batch-1",
      "playerId": "{{PLAYER_ID}}",
      "originServerId": "{{SERVER_ID}}",
      "channelKey": "global",
      "message": "Batch message A"
    },
    {
      "producerMessageId": "manual-batch-2",
      "actorId": "{{ACTOR_ID}}",
      "originServerId": "{{SERVER_ID}}",
      "channelKey": "staff",
      "message": "Batch message B"
    }
  ]
}
